{"id":"5ea22a6dca","t":"!Shadow Of The Reborn Rogue’s Dominion","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/1624781047195097993-193x278.jpg","n":60,"l":60,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion"},"u":1795038939573,"desc":"يتجول في وحشة العزلة، ساعيًا وراء عواقب أفعاله، وهذه هي أغنية اللص. لقد أعاد ني يان عقارب الساعة عشر سنوات إلى الوراء. كل فرصة ضاعت منه، وكل حق انتُزع منه قسرًا، سيستعيده بلا شك. سيرتدي درع نيفي بالكامل، الذي سيسحق به أشد أعدائه، ويهزم الحكام إن تجرأوا على الوقوف في طريقه، وستصبح قوته قوة لا تُقهر إلى الأبد.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","ايسكاى","بطل غير اعتيادى","قوة خارقة","نظام"],"src":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/1/"},"2":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/2/"},"3":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/3/"},"4":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/4/"},"5":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/5/"},"6":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/6/"},"7":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/7/"},"8":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/8/"},"9":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/9/"},"10":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/10/"},"11":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/11/"},"12":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/12/"},"13":{"ml":"shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion|/manga/shadow-of-the-reborn-rogues-dominion/13/"},"14":{"ml":"shadow